flowchart TD
  A[Start tick t] --> F[Fork arriving passengers]
  F --> R[Read exact request bytes and sort IDs]
  R --> AS[Assign unassigned waiting passengers]
  AS --> L[For each lift choose target]
  L --> X{At target?}
  X -->|yes| S[Drop then board in ID order]
  X -->|no| M[Move one floor]
  L -->|no stop| I[Idle]
  S & M & I --> B[Write floor board]
  B --> V[Render and record frame]
  V --> W[Reap eligible children]
  W --> N[t = t + 1]
